-- Loads all 382 current UK principal councils (excludes combined authorities and the GLA).
-- Sources: mySociety uk_local_authority_names_and_codes (names, GSS codes, types, regions)
-- and Wikidata (websites; logos/coats of arms hosted on Wikimedia Commons), 27 Oct 2026.
-- Existing councils keep their id, name and any website already set; their type,
-- region, code and emblem are refreshed. Five were previously mistyped as metropolitan
-- (Derby, Kingston upon Hull, Leicester, Nottingham, Stoke-on-Trent) and become unitary.
-- Derbyshire and Lincolnshire regions are corrected to East Midlands (source data error).
-- Emblem kind: L = council logo, A = coat of arms. File = Wikimedia Commons file name.

